export anchor SalesLeaderboardStyle:
    number: 340
    screen: CrmPipeline
    name: Sales leaderboard
    idea: The pipeline as a friendly sales league on deep indigo, with an owner podium ranked by open value, earned badges and streaks drawn from real deal events, a quarter quest bar toward target and the stages as levels on a quest board.
    base: dark
    palette:
        indigo: #15122b, the page and the style sheet
        card: #211c40, panels, levels and moves
        raised: #2c2552, tokens, tiles, podium steps and secondary buttons
        line: #3d3570, the quest bar frame and field borders
        ink: #f4f1ff, text
        muted: #b5addb, labels and owners
        gold: #ffd166, rank 1, the quest bar, primary button and Mara tokens
        silver: #cfd6e6, rank 2 and Sam tokens
        bronze: #f0a875, rank 3 and Lena tokens
        onGold: #211400, text on gold, silver and bronze
        mint: #6ee7b7, Won and the team win
        coral: #ff8fa3, Stalled and Gone quiet with a triangle
        sky: #8ecbff, Booked and Closer badges and focus
    type:
        Display in Impact, Haettenschweiler, Franklin Gothic Bold, Arial
        Black at weight 800 with no synthetic bold, body in Trebuchet MS,
        Segoe UI, system-ui. Base 15px. The title is 36px, the won figure
        40px, podium values 26px, section heads 22px, names 15px at 700,
        caps labels and badges 12px at 700.
    layout:
        A header with a tracked caps line Brightwork Sales Deal pipeline
        over Q4 Sales League with League in gold, and My deals and a gold
        Log a deal button. Two panels follow. Leaderboard open value holds
        a three step podium, Sam Ortiz second, Mara Okafor first and Lena
        Fischer third, each with a hexagon initials avatar in a medal
        colour, the open value, 2 open deals, pill badges and a step with
        its rank number. Badges are Biggest deal and Demo booked for Mara,
        Closer for Sam and a flame 3 opens for Lena. Quarter quest shows
        Won this quarter 128,500, a striped gold bar at 64 percent, 71,500
        to go, level 64 of 100 and three tiles for pipeline value, win rate
        and open deals. Quest board shows five levels L1 to L5 with tokens
        edged in the owner medal colour, Bluewater Clinics marked team win
        in mint. Latest moves holds three cards labelled Booked, Streak 3
        opens and Gone quiet. On phones panels stack and levels go one
        across while the podium keeps three steps.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px panel padding, 12px between levels and moves, 28px gutter, 16px on phones.
    density: Medium. Big figures and a podium up top, compact tokens below.
    corners: Chunky. 20px panels, 18px levels, 14px tokens, buttons and fields, hexagon avatars and pill badges.
    borders: Few. A 5px left edge on each token in the owner medal colour, 2px badge rings and a 6px top edge on podium steps.
    shadows: Solid offset shadows with no blur, 0 4px to 0 6px, so buttons and panels look like game pieces.
    icons:
        Line icons at 2 stroke. Trophy, star, hexagon and bolt head the
        sections. A flame marks a streak, a triangle gone quiet, a check won.
    focus: A 3px sky outline offset 3px.
    tone: Playful but plain, such as Sales League, Quarter quest, Log a deal, 71,500 to go and Gone quiet.
